    <h2>Step-by-Step Guide: How to Remove SynthID from Gemini Images and Veo Video</h2>
    <p>
      Sanitizing AI assets on RemoveSynth requires no command line tools, complex software installations, or expensive subscriptions. Follow these straightforward steps:
    </p>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li>
        <strong>Upload Your File to the Processing Stage:</strong> Drag and drop your image (PNG, JPG, WebP), video clip (MP4, WebM, MOV), or audio file (MP3, WAV, M4A) directly into the upload card above. You can also click the browse area to select files from your desktop or mobile file picker.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Automatic Multi-Modal Inspection:</strong> The engine automatically detects the input media type and initializes the corresponding WebAssembly processing module. Container atoms (`udta`, `uuid`, C2PA provenance blocks) are parsed and isolated in under 50 milliseconds.
      </li>
      <li>
